{
    "title": "Spider Solitaire - Card Games",
    "description": "<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is a challenging new version of the classic solitaire card game, also known as Patience, which is easy to play but difficult to master! Card games are a great way to keep your mind sharp, so if you want to relax while you train your brain, <b>Spider Solitaire</b> is the game you were looking for \ud83d\ude09\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f<b>Did you know\u2026</b>\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f\r\nThat the name for the Spider Solitaire card game comes from the spider's eight legs, referencing the eight foundation piles that must be filled to win the game?\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd13 Test your skills in this <b>free</b> Spider Solitaire card game \r\n\u23f3 Play Spider Solitaire while you commute or wait, you'll relax, making the most of your time\r\n\ud83d\udc51 Earn medals by completing Daily Challenges and becoming a Spider Solitaire Master! \ud83d\udd77\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udccf<b>How to play Spider Solitaire classic card game?</b>\ud83c\udccf\r\nPlaying Spider Solitaire is easy if you like playing cards. Place all the cards in each suit in stacks of descending order. Weave your way as a beginner through 1 and 2 suit games and move up in difficulty as you attempt to tackle 3 and 4 suit games and become a true Spider Solitaire master!\r\n \r\nSpider Solitaire challenges you to stack all cards of each suit in descending order to solve the puzzle. Try it now to earn points, climb the leaderboard, and become the best Spider Solitaire master.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1<b>Spider Solitaire Highlights</b> \ud83d\udca1\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Play Spider Solitaire offline - no wifi required\r\n\u2660\ufe0f BIG FONT option\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Timer Mode option if you want to play in challenge mode\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Play on any device (phone & tablet friendly)\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Single tap, or drag & drop to move cards\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Multiple languages supported\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f <b>Spider Solitaire Special Features</b> \u2b50\ufe0f \r\n\u2666\ufe0e Left-handed mode\r\n\u2666\ufe0e Auto-complete option\r\n\u2666\ufe0e Exciting daily challenges with amazing rewards\r\n\u2666\ufe0e Customisable card faces, card backs, and backgrounds\r\n\u2666\ufe0e If you get stuck, use the hints\r\n\u2666\ufe0e Spider Solitaire Draw-1 or Draw-3 cards mode\r\n\u2666\ufe0e Personal statistics to check your progress\r\n\u2666\ufe0e Enjoy the Spider Solitaire card deciding how many suits you want to play with! \ud83c\udccf\r\n\r\nDo you like classic card games like TriPeak Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, Spades, or Hearts? Then you will love this classic <b>Spider Solitaire</b> card game, a fun and challenging way to play one of the most popular card games in the world! Solitaire card games have been played for hundreds of years because they greatly benefit your brain and improve your relaxation.\r\n\r\nDo you have what it takes to weave the challenging webs of cards and become the next Spider Solitaire master? \ud83e\udd34\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f\ud83d\udc78 Download now the best free spider solitaire cards game and join thousands of Spider Solitaire players on Android!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is a challenging new version of the classic solitaire card game, also known as Patience, which is easy to play but difficult to master! Card games are a great way to keep your mind sharp, so if you want to relax while you train your brain, <b>Spider Solitaire</b> is the game you were looking for \ud83d\ude09<br><br>\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f<b>Did you know\u2026</b>\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f<br>That the name for the Spider Solitaire card game comes from the spider&#39;s eight legs, referencing the eight foundation piles that must be filled to win the game?<br><br>\ud83e\udd13 Test your skills in this <b>free</b> Spider Solitaire card game <br>\u23f3 Play Spider Solitaire while you commute or wait, you&#39;ll relax, making the most of your time<br>\ud83d\udc51 Earn medals by completing Daily Challenges and becoming a Spider Solitaire Master! \ud83d\udd77\ufe0f<br><br>\ud83c\udccf<b>How to play Spider Solitaire classic card game?</b>\ud83c\udccf<br>Playing Spider Solitaire is easy if you like playing cards. Place all the cards in each suit in stacks of descending order. Weave your way as a beginner through 1 and 2 suit games and move up in difficulty as you attempt to tackle 3 and 4 suit games and become a true Spider Solitaire master!<br> <br>Spider Solitaire challenges you to stack all cards of each suit in descending order to solve the puzzle. Try it now to earn points, climb the leaderboard, and become the best Spider Solitaire master.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1<b>Spider Solitaire Highlights</b> \ud83d\udca1<br>\u2660\ufe0f Play Spider Solitaire offline - no wifi required<br>\u2660\ufe0f BIG FONT option<br>\u2660\ufe0f Timer Mode option if you want to play in challenge mode<br>\u2660\ufe0f Play on any device (phone &amp; tablet friendly)<br>\u2660\ufe0f Single tap, or drag &amp; drop to move cards<br>\u2660\ufe0f Multiple languages supported<br><br>\u2b50\ufe0f <b>Spider Solitaire Special Features</b> \u2b50\ufe0f <br>\u2666\ufe0e Left-handed mode<br>\u2666\ufe0e Auto-complete option<br>\u2666\ufe0e Exciting daily challenges with amazing rewards<br>\u2666\ufe0e Customisable card faces, card backs, and backgrounds<br>\u2666\ufe0e If you get stuck, use the hints<br>\u2666\ufe0e Spider Solitaire Draw-1 or Draw-3 cards mode<br>\u2666\ufe0e Personal statistics to check your progress<br>\u2666\ufe0e Enjoy the Spider Solitaire card deciding how many suits you want to play with! \ud83c\udccf<br><br>Do you like classic card games like TriPeak Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, Spades, or Hearts? Then you will love this classic <b>Spider Solitaire</b> card game, a fun and challenging way to play one of the most popular card games in the world! Solitaire card games have been played for hundreds of years because they greatly benefit your brain and improve your relaxation.<br><br>Do you have what it takes to weave the challenging webs of cards and become the next Spider Solitaire master? \ud83e\udd34\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f\ud83d\udc78 Download now the best free spider solitaire cards game and join thousands of Spider Solitaire players on Android!",
